  READING: small L -> |Corr|/(N base) < 1 (S_N>0 at small N => j* small, kps route wins);
  near-AP (L~k) -> ratio >> 1 (resonant, S154 L^1 divergence) => route needs N~ceil(7(k-1)/6)
  or mac-mini's embedded-AP Dirichlet.  UNIFIES kps-S90 + mac-mini + opus-S154/S164.
